{
  "id": "DbaSgWUuwrx",
  "title": "Video by ilyas.men.advice",
  "description": "Do Men Have Rights? Do Men Have Feelings?\n\nA woman made a video saying men have rights, feelings, and deserve to be heard - and she got enough pushback from parts of her own audience that she made several follow-up videos explaining herself. I break down why that reaction is worth talking about, and why I respect what she did even though we likely disagree on plenty. It takes character to tell your own crowd they are going too far - and voices like hers are the ones people actually listen to.\n\n#reaction #debate #logic #criticalthinking #discussion",
